# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make asan` runs (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=tools/lsan.supp).
# Handles the headless SDL3 stub hands out and gui.cpp caches for the life of
# the process (fonts, cursors, textures): external-library resources, not
# interpreter heap objects.
leak:TTF_OpenFont
leak:SDL_CreateSystemCursor
leak:SDL_CreateTexture
leak:SDL_CreateRenderer
leak:SDL_CreateWindow
leak:IMG_Load
